    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like the chaos would just destroy everything. if i let it all fall apart, i'm terrified that there's nothing underneath. like, what if there's nothing there to catch me? it's not just about being free from them, it's about the fact that i can't see a single way out that doesn't involve everything ending.",
